# Copy to apps/web/.env.local (local dev) or set in the Render dashboard (deployment). Never commit real values.
# Only the project URL and the PUBLISHABLE (anon) key belong here: they are public by design, and
# Row Level Security in the database is what protects the data.
# NEVER put a service_role key, a database password, or any other privileged secret into a VITE_* variable:
# everything prefixed VITE_ is compiled into the public JavaScript bundle.
#
# Leave both empty to run in local-only mode (IndexedDB + demo data, no sign-in), exactly as in Phase 3.
VITE_SUPABASE_URL=
VITE_SUPABASE_PUBLISHABLE_KEY=
